    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bca15bdb5e6d6bf948bfd6</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 12:21:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>虽说实践出真知，但白日梦也能激发快乐和想象力！</span></p><span></span><p><span>劳动最光荣，但做梦也有理！</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为抛开行动，有时候畅想本身就是意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>*wawa幻想中2000万彩票，提前做好excel表</span></p><span></span><p><span>*我们的奥运冠军梦：赛道必须够小众</span></p><span></span><p><span>*人人都有一个帝王梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>*如果能穿越到《哈利波特》里……</span></p><span></span><p><span>*做梦回到东晋跟葛洪修道！</span></p><span></span><p><span>*每个女生都想象过成为天下第一大美女</span></p><span></span><p><span>*明星梦之《我已经想好了如何应对黑粉》</span></p><span></span><p><span>*梦中的商业版图和300字头衔的百度百科</span></p><span></span><p><span>*Crash：见面三分钟，脑补30万字大戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>*实践出真知，但白日梦也有存在的价值！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tom And Jerry - Bradley</span></p><span></span><p><span>Breakfast in Bed - Jazzinuf</span></p><span></span><p><span>SpongeBob Closing Theme - Various Artists</span></p>]]></description>
