    <guid isPermaLink="false">66aa076c7349f7a557d34ea5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 31 Jul 2024 09:44:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>过量饮酒有害健康，但适当小酌带来的荒唐二三事怎能缺席我们的人生？</span></p><span></span><p><span>*5岁刀刀干掉整杯红酒震撼社交现场</span></p><span></span><p><span>*90后的共同饮酒第一课：KTV</span></p><span></span><p><span>*喝假酒与喝断片的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span>*拿破仑出租车上吐遍西安市，昏迷中不忘叮嘱司机别绕路</span></p><span></span><p><span>*毕业狂欢夜刀刀偶遇wawa学校风云人物，一张照片引发离谱谣言</span></p><span></span><p><span>*wawa的新婚之夜是如何被我们喝没的</span></p><span></span><p><span>*喝酒：快速鉴定人品的方式之一</span></p><span></span><p><span>*人生得意须尽欢，莫使金樽空对月</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>dream of me - Jack CC,40oz</span></p><span></span><p><span>Espresso - Jazzinuf</span></p><span></span><p><span>Miami - Baxter Dury</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ecstasy - Penthouse Penthouse</span></p><span></span><p><span>Felix Mendelssohn - 婚礼进行曲</span></p><span></span><p><span>Golden - Jill Scott</span></p>]]></description>
